| `docs/spec/emerge-yaml.schema.json` | emerge.yaml JSON Schema (versioned) |
| `sdk/src/emerge/` | emerge SDK (decorator, CLI, A2A server) |

## Do NOT Edit (Generated Files)

- `common/proto/src/*_pb2.py` — generated from `.proto` files via `grpc-generate`
- `common/proto/src/*_pb2_grpc.py` — same
- `common/proto/src/*_pb2.pyi` — same
- `common/database/src/generated_client/` — generated by `prisma generate`

Edit the source (`.proto` or `schema.prisma`) and regenerate instead.

## Kafka Topic Names

**Workflow stream** (Gateway ↔ Runtime):
- `workflow_requests` — Gateway → Runtime
- `workflow_events` — Runtime → Gateway
- `workflow_interrupts` — Gateway → Runtime (human-in-the-loop)

Consumer groups: `runtime-workers` (Runtime), `gateway-streamers` (Gateway).

**Planning & registry** (created by `scripts/run-all.sh`):
- `registry.agent.registered` — Registry → PnD embedding pipeline
- `gateway.user.query`, `planning.manifest.created`, `planning.validation.failed`, `execution.step_complete`

